    "## first model : k-means ignoring time\n",
    "Now we are finding the 6 virtual ambulances locations by grouping over the crashes locations in to 6 groups.\n",
    "we are using a popular and easy to understand algorithm called KMeans to group over the craches places.\n",
    "in this first part we will ignore the time feature in this first part this means we will predict a fixed places for the 6 ambulances."
   ]
